  "html": "<p>The Lava Crypt layout is a variation of the Crypt.  Its walls are lined with skeletons in various tormented positions, chains and cages.  The cracks in the floor are filled with bubbling lava. It is a very dark dungeon (this picture has been brightened) and the first hint you get of nearby mobs may be the glow emanating from fire creatures.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<th>Lava Crypt Layout Appearance\n</th><th>Lava Crypt Layout Typical Map\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Layout_Torture.jpg\" title=\"Layout Torture.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"195\" src=\"/images/Layout_Torture.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Layout_Torture.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Map_Torture.jpg\" title=\"Map Torture.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"384\" src=\"/images/Map_Torture.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Map_Torture.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div></div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
